    <!-- Settings/About screen (see ui/screens/about/AboutScreen.kt) — Blick's own language
         picker, reachable from the routine list's top app bar, plus the one place
         attribution_text above is actually shown to the user, a link to Trafiklab.se ("when
         practicable", see docs/api-contract.md §8), and the one place the privacy policy is
         shown — see docs/api-contract.md §8's own note that this project has no separate
         hosted privacy-policy page. about_action/about_title deliberately keep their original
         resource names even though the screen now covers more than "about" — same convention
         as routine_details_title's own doc: renaming an internal id has no user-facing benefit. -->
    <string name="about_action">Settings</string>
    <string name="about_title">Settings</string>
